# Operational runbooks. LAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md named the deploy wallet, the on-disk path of the deployer
# key, and the fact that all five multisig signer keys live in one folder on one machine. That is a
# targeting package, not a secret leak -- no key material was ever in the repo -- but it tells an
# attacker exactly which machine and which files yield the whole multisig. Untracked; treat the
# contents as permanently disclosed and re-key before mainnet.
LAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md

# Describes where key material lives. Same class of file as the runbook that leaked.
/REKEY.md
